    <briefdescription>
<para>One compiled Shadertoy-compatible shader pass. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Owns an OpenGLShaderProgram, caches Shadertoy uniform locations, and binds up to 4 iChannel textures per render call.</para>
<para><ref refid="structshader_1_1_pass_1af67411e5658785759c900808b548e962" kindref="member">compile()</ref> wraps the user&apos;s fragment shader with the Shadertoy uniform block and mainImage→main bridge, then translates via OpenGLHelpers::translateFragmentShaderToV3 for GL version portability.</para>
<para>Thread contract: ALL methods GL THREAD only. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
